{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8b17b35762f6dcc11a5b2fc73bf4bb4caf1ac16b0a18d8733cb1b56ba744907c", "ja": "（そろそろ飛行機の時間だというのに、\n亜利沙の姿がない……どこに行ったんだ？）", "zh": "（飞机就快起飞了，\n怎么还没看到亚利沙……她上哪去了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1001_se", "source_sha256": "7c676c69290c446ed495142af9d6901dc40479ed23c3dae17cda583f7b9df6c6", "ja": "パシャパシャ！　パシャパシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓！喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "dcc48bd1501525c680b9b7b3790a369cdc009c39799eb029d83f854b788d64ac", "ja": "ムフフ……♪　アイドルちゃんたちが、\nプライベートビーチで戯れる姿……最高です～っ！", "zh": "唔呼呼……♪偶像宝贝们在私人海滩上玩闹的模样……\n简直太棒了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c29a2a3885e1e5d426f195cf1bdc88e1cbaece785df6c91fe36948f4e2949745", "ja": "あっ、亜利沙！　こんなところにいたのか！", "zh": "啊，亚利沙！原来你在这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "d254cfa306b68b6970843a9f6d436f1ac6784dadc497586a154352fc1fd8736a", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}さん？\nどうしたんですか、そんなに慌てて……。", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生？\n发生什么事了吗？怎么那么慌张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1005_p", "source_sha256": "802cf156203b991bfac64fe8e1230422c2af422f4d6b26377a26e474a4a8b0fc", "ja": "どうしたって、もう飛行機が出る時間だぞ！\n急いで空港に向かわないと……。", "zh": "你还敢问，飞机就快起飞了！\n要马上赶去机场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "45e4e5a6a0b1329f5c9696ff153ef46d7f89d0da80b289c7ff7dbfe3183a1ce7", "ja": "えっ！？　も、もうそんな時間だったんですか！\nありさ、すっかりアイドルちゃんのプライベート……。", "zh": "什么！？已、已经这么晚了吗！？\n亚利沙完全沉浸在偶像宝贝的私人时间里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "c5bad2292f13daf73e87c0bda6e61d1128e54630d8e1b8225abf7aa024492cbe", "ja": "……ではなく！　そう、参考のための取材をですね！\nしていたんですけど！", "zh": "……不对！亚利沙的意思是，拍照当作参考！\n虽说亚利沙本来就一直在拍照了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d7056892bdd446eaebe0e14bcb26ee7bc3c3f5c7f47e3e29cb8f1dcf134daa6d", "ja": "いや……亜利沙もアイドルで、ここには仕事で\n来ていたんだが……。まぁいい、とにかく走ろう！", "zh": "不是啊……亚利沙，你自己也是偶像，\n而且我们不是来工作的吗……算了，赶快跑起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "36008c0f24f338fd499921109eab22f54d0ecd66245d625e9ae433eb9d296f5b", "ja": "うぅ、{$P$}さぁん……。\nありさ、急ぎますーっ！", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生……\n亚利沙会跑快一点的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0032_1010_p", "source_sha256": "df38e5b5a43b7ffb439a6e448b26638b3ac2284ebe44174aecfe9005105f5e69", "ja": "よし！　とりあえずタクシー乗り場までダッシュだ！", "zh": "好！那就先冲到乘车区坐计程车吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
